&lt;div aria-labelledby=&quot;bs-faq-prod-68-button-3&quot; class=&quot;bs-faq-panel&quot; hidden=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;bs-faq-prod-68-panel-3&quot; role=&quot;region&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Так, ми продаємо лише оригінальні японські бустери One Piece Card Game від Bandai.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;bs-faq-item&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3 class=&quot;bs-faq-question&quot;&gt;&lt;button aria-controls=&quot;bs-faq-prod-68-panel-4&quot; aria-expanded=&quot;false&quot; class=&quot;bs-faq-toggle&quot; data-bs-faq-toggle=&quot;&quot; id=&quot;bs-faq-prod-68-button-4&quot; type=&quot;button&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Чи бустери закуповуються з box/case?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;

